  "description": "<p class='problem-lead'>把字串重複接起來指定次數。</p><p>請讀取字串 <code>a</code> 與整數 <code>b</code>，輸出把 <code>a</code> 重複 <code>b</code> 次後直接相接的結果，重複之間不加任何分隔符號。當 <code>b = 0</code> 時，輸出空字串（也就是輸出空白的一行）。</p>",
  "hint": "<p>Python 的字串可以直接用 <code>*</code> 乘上一個整數來重複。</p>",
  "inputFormat": "<p>第一行包含字串 <code>a</code>，第二行包含一個整數 <code>b</code>。</p>",
  "outputFormat": "<p>一行，輸出 <code>a</code> 重複 <code>b</code> 次相接的結果；若 <code>b = 0</code> 則輸出空白的一行。</p>",
  "constraints": "<ul><li>1 ≤ a 的字元數 ≤ 20</li><li>0 ≤ b ≤ 10</li></ul>",
  "timeLimit": 1,
  "memoryLimit": 256,
  "sampleInput": "Go\n3",
  "sampleOutput": "GoGoGo",
  "samples": [
    { "input": "Go\n3", "output": "GoGoGo" },
    { "input": "*\n5", "output": "*****" },
    { "input": "a\n0", "output": "" }
  ],
  "testCases": [
    { "input": "Go\n3", "output": "GoGoGo" },
    { "input": "*\n5", "output": "*****" },
    { "input": "a\n0", "output": "" },
    { "input": "a\n1", "output": "a" },
    { "input": "ab\n2", "output": "abab" },
    { "input": "Hi\n10", "output": "HiHiHiHiHiHiHiHiHiHi" },
    { "input": "x\n0", "output": "" },
    { "input": "程式\n3", "output": "程式程式程式" },
    { "input": "AB CD\n2", "output": "AB CDAB CD" },
    { "input": "Z\n10", "output": "ZZZZZZZZZZ" }
  ],
